    "name": "performing-cloud-forensics-investigation",
    "description": "Collect and analyze cloud forensic evidence using AWS CLI, Azure CLI, or gcloud to snapshot volumes, capture instance metadata and security group configurations, and preserve cloud-native logs (CloudTrail, Activity Log, Audit Log). Use when investigating a suspected breach in AWS, Azure, or GCP, tracing unauthorized access through API logs, or analyzing a compromised VM, container, or serverless function.",
